    {
      "doc_id": "FAQ-027",
      "query": "This FAQ-027 talks about lubricant selection — how do I interpret the guidance here when choosing between approved oils for a new part family? Are there quick rules of thumb or do I need engineering sign-off every time?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "FAQ-003",
      "query": "I'm a bit lost on FAQ-003: it references allowable machining tolerances — can you summarize which tolerances are treated as critical vs functional, and when a part out-of-tolerance must go through rework vs scrap?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SOP-P1-L4-01",
      "query": "Line startup for the Heat Treat line — can you give me a step-by-step checklist of what must be verified before starting production, including safety interlocks, control setpoints, and any sample parts or test cycles required?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SB-1049",
      "query": "Safety bulletin about pinch points during die change — what are the specific high-risk steps called out here and what PPE and lockout/tagout steps are mandated to prevent finger or hand injuries?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SB-1021",
      "query": "Regarding the arc flash risks at the induction power cabinet in SB-1021: what tasks are considered high risk, what additional arc-rated PPE is required, and do I need special qualification to access that cabinet?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SB-1019",
      "query": "The SB-1019 bulletin warns about quench oil fire risk — can you explain the conditions that increase fire likelihood and the emergency steps operators should follow if smoke or fire is detected in the quench area?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SOP-P3-L3-02",
      "query": "For Product changeover on the Machining line SOP, I'm not clear on the calibration and verification steps — when do we need to run sample pieces, and what acceptance criteria do we use before declaring the line ready?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SOP-P3-L4-01",
      "query": "Line startup for the Heat Treat line (SOP-P3-L4-01) — how does this differ from SOP-P1-L4-01? I saw both listed and want to know which to follow depending on the shift or product."
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SB-1038",
      "query": "Another safety bulletin on pinch points during die change — is this an update or different from SB-1049? What new controls or observations should I be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SOP-P2-L3-01",
      "query": "Line startup - Machining line: as a new hire, what daily startup verifications are REQUIRED before loading the first pallet? I'm thinking about coolant levels, spindle checks, tool offsets — which are mandatory according to this SOP?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SOP-P2-L3-02",
      "query": "Product changeover - Machining line SOP: when switching between families with different clamping fixtures, does the procedure here require fixture verification by QC, or can the operator perform a dimensional check and proceed?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SB-1037",
