    {
      "doc_id": "SOP-P3-L3-04",
      "query": "Shift handover - Machining line: what information must be included in the handover log per this SOP? Also, are there examples of good vs poor handovers so I can learn what level of detail is expected?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SB-1010",
      "query": "Safety bulletin SB-1010 on noise exposure — can you summarize which operations are highlighted as high noise and what hearing protection levels are required? Also, is there a process for requesting quieter tooling?"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "SB-1029",
      "query": "Another noise exposure bulletin SB-1029 — does this add new requirements beyond SB-1010, or is it targeted to different areas? I want to make sure I'm following the latest hearing protection guidance."
       }
